  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xe9;ponse d&#x2019;urgence aux cons&#xe9;quences sanitaires de la crise humanitaire complexe - dans les Provinces du Nord-Kivu et du Sud-Kivu dans l&#x2019;Est de la R&#xe9;publique D&#xe9;mocratique du Congo.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to internally displaced person, returnees and host communities  in North and South Kivu. This WHO project provides access to essential primary healthcare services, conducts disease surveillance, and supports efforts to prevent sexual exploitation and abuse. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 376,000 people, including 113,000 women, 106,000 men, 157,000 children, and including 55,000 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
